        <mxCell id="title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=40;fontColor=#F4F7FB;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;height:150px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height: 46px; line-height: 46px; margin-top: -8px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(244, 247, 251); white-space: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 48px;&quot;&gt;The types of vowel lengthening (madd)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction: rtl; height: 62px; line-height: 62px; margin-top: 4px; color: rgb(244, 247, 251); white-space: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 54px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;أقسام المدّ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height: 20px; line-height: 20px; margin-top: 6px; color: rgb(169, 182, 211); white-space: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The lengths are for the reading of Ḥafṣ from &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Lucida Sans Unicode&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Lucida Grande&amp;quot;, Tahoma, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;ʿ&lt;/span&gt;Āṣim by the Shāṭibiyyah route.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height: 20px; line-height: 20px; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(169, 182, 211); white-space: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;One &quot;count&quot; is the time of one short vowel.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="900" x="970" y="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;div style=&quot;width: 336px; height: 210px; color: rgb(11, 19, 36);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height: 36px; line-height: 36px; font-weight: bold; white-space: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;Vowel Lengthening&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction: rtl; height: 44px; line-height: 44px; white-space: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 42px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;المدّ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:24px;margin:6px 0px 8px 0px;display:flex;align-items:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 0%; height: 1px; background-color: rgb(129, 136, 148);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:92px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 20px; text-align: center; text-wrap: balance;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;A long vowel or a soft letter is held.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:30px;line-height:30px;margin-top:2px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic; margin-right: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px;&quot;&gt;like&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 28px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: isolate;&quot;&gt;قَالَ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px 10px;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: isolate;&quot;&gt;يَقُولُ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px 10px;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: isolate;&quot;&gt;ءَآلْءَانَ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin: 0px 10px;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: isolate;&quot;&gt;خَوْفٍ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vowel Lengthening&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Condition:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vowel Lengthening:&lt;/b&gt; A long vowel or a soft letter is held. A long vowel is an alif, wāw or yāʾ that has no vowel of its own and follows its matching vowel: alif after a fatḥah, wāw after a ḍammah, yāʾ after a kasrah. A soft letter is a wāw or yāʾ that has no vowel of its own and follows a fatḥah.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Examples:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:30px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:19px;&quot;&gt;قَالَ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;long vowel: alif after a fatḥah · al-Baqarah 2:30&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:30px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:19px;&quot;&gt;يَقُولُ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;long vowel: wāw after a ḍammah · al-Baqarah 2:8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:30px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:19px;&quot;&gt;ءَآلْءَانَ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;long vowel: alif after a fatḥah · Yūnus 10:51&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:30px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:19px;&quot;&gt;خَوْفٍ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;soft letter: wāw after a fatḥah · Quraysh 106:4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:2px;&quot;&gt;Length is measured in counts; one count is the time of one short vowel. A soft letter is lengthened in only two places below: Soft letter, and the name of the letter &lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:17px;&quot;&gt;ع&lt;/span&gt;. Everywhere else the letter is a long vowel. All three long vowels are in one word: &lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:17px;&quot;&gt;نُوحِيهَا&lt;/span&gt; (Hūd 11:49).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" id="madd">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=28;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8EDF6;strokeColor=#F2F5FA;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#0B1324;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;shadow=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="230" width="360" x="1240" y="240" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;div style=&quot;width:336px;height:210px;color:#0B1324;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:36px;line-height:36px;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;Natural&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction:rtl;height:44px;line-height:44px;font-size:32px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;الأصلي (الطبيعي)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:24px;margin:6px 0px 8px 0px;display:flex;align-items:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;flex:1;height:1px;background-color:#638271;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;flex:none;box-sizing:border-box;width:132px;height:24px;line-height:24px;border-radius:12px;background-color:#0B1324;color:#B2E7B6;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;2 counts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;flex:1;height:1px;background-color:#638271;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:92px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;text-wrap:balance;&quot;&gt;The lengthening has no cause. The letter is a long vowel with no hamzah right before or right after it and no sukūn on the next letter.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:30px;line-height:30px;margin-top:2px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-style:italic;margin-right:10px;&quot;&gt;like&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:isolate;font-size:20px;&quot;&gt;مَالِكِ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20px;margin:0px 10px;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:isolate;font-size:20px;&quot;&gt;مَرْفُوعَةٍ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20px;margin:0px 10px;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:isolate;font-size:20px;&quot;&gt;كَثِيرَةً&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Natural&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;All of these conditions apply, top box first:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Vowel Lengthening: A long vowel or a soft letter is held.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Natural:&lt;/b&gt; The lengthening has no cause. The letter is a long vowel with no hamzah right before or right after it and no sukūn on the next letter.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Length:&lt;/b&gt; 2 counts.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Examples:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:30px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:19px;&quot;&gt;مَالِكِ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;alif · al-Fātiḥah 1:4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:30px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:19px;&quot;&gt;مَرْفُوعَةٍ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;wāw · al-Wāqiʿah 56:34&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:30px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:19px;&quot;&gt;كَثِيرَةً&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;yāʾ · al-Baqarah 2:245&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:2px;&quot;&gt;In Hūd 11:49 a hamzah follows &lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:17px;&quot;&gt;نُوحِيهَا&lt;/span&gt;. Unless you stop on the word, its last alif is Separated, not Natural.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" id="natural">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=28;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#B2E7B6;strokeColor=#D5F2D7;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#0B1324;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;shadow=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="230" width="360" x="1040" y="530" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;div style=&quot;width:336px;height:210px;color:#0B1324;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:36px;line-height:36px;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;Secondary&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction:rtl;height:44px;line-height:44px;font-size:32px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;الفرعي&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:24px;margin:6px 0px 8px 0px;display:flex;align-items:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;flex:1;height:1px;background-color:#818894;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:92px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;text-wrap:balance;&quot;&gt;The lengthening has a cause, one of two: a hamzah right before or right after the letter, or a sukūn on the next letter.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:30px;line-height:30px;margin-top:2px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-style:italic;margin-right:10px;&quot;&gt;like&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:isolate;font-size:20px;&quot;&gt;جَآءَ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20px;margin:0px 10px;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:isolate;font-size:20px;&quot;&gt;الْحَآقَّةُ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Secondary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;All of these conditions apply, top box first:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Vowel Lengthening: A long vowel or a soft letter is held.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Secondary:&lt;/b&gt; The lengthening has a cause, one of two: a hamzah right before or right after the letter, or a sukūn on the next letter.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Examples:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:30px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:19px;&quot;&gt;جَآءَ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;a hamzah right after the alif · an-Naṣr 110:1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:30px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:19px;&quot;&gt;الْحَآقَّةُ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;a sukūn on its first qāf · al-Ḥāqqah 69:1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:2px;&quot;&gt;Any length beyond 2 counts comes from the cause. If one letter meets the conditions of two kinds, the stronger kind applies. From the strongest: Required, Connected, At a stop, Separated, Substituted.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" id="secondary">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=28;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8EDF6;strokeColor=#F2F5FA;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#0B1324;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;shadow=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="230" width="360" x="1440" y="530" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;div style=&quot;width:336px;height:210px;color:#0B1324;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:36px;line-height:36px;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;Caused by hamzah&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction:rtl;height:44px;line-height:44px;font-size:32px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;بسبب الهمز&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:24px;margin:6px 0px 8px 0px;display:flex;align-items:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;flex:1;height:1px;background-color:#826730;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:92px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;text-align:center;text-wrap:balance;&quot;&gt;The cause is a hamzah right before or right after the letter, and the letter is a long vowel.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;height:30px;line-height:30px;margin-top:2px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-style:italic;margin-right:10px;&quot;&gt;like&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:isolate;font-size:20px;&quot;&gt;جَآءَ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20px;margin:0px 10px;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:isolate;font-size:20px;&quot;&gt;بِمَآ أُنْزِلَ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20px;margin:0px 10px;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:isolate;font-size:20px;&quot;&gt;ءَادَمَ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" tooltip="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Caused by hamzah&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;All of these conditions apply, top box first:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Vowel Lengthening: A long vowel or a soft letter is held.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Secondary: The lengthening has a cause, one of two: a hamzah right before or right after the letter, or a sukūn on the next letter.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Caused by hamzah:&lt;/b&gt; The cause is a hamzah right before or right after the letter, and the letter is a long vowel.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Examples:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:30px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:19px;&quot;&gt;جَآءَ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Hamzah after the alif · an-Naṣr 110:1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:30px;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:19px;&quot;&gt;ءَادَمَ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left:8px;&quot;&gt;Hamzah before the alif · al-Baqarah 2:31&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:2px;&quot;&gt;A hamzah does not lengthen a soft letter: in &lt;span dir=&quot;rtl&quot; style=&quot;font-size:17px;&quot;&gt;شَيْءٍ&lt;/span&gt; nothing is lengthened unless you stop on the word.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" id="hamza">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=28;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F6B93B;strokeColor=#FAD893;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#0B1324;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;shadow=0;" vertex="1">
